[Term]
id: EMPTY:0000170
name: EYFP engram average cell count
def: "Average number of cells positive for both EYFP (EYFP+; encoding) and c-Fos (c-Fos+; retrieval) as a percentage compared to total number of EYFP+ cells in a region or individual. Overlapping cells positive for both EYFP and c-Fos are indicative of memory traces or engrams." []
is_a: EMPTY:0000167 ! cell count

[Term]
id: EMPTY:0000171
